# ── SOFIAS ASSISTANT PRO — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.
#
# SYNTAX WARNING — .gitignore has no inline comments. A '#' starts a comment only
# at the beginning of a line. Anywhere else it is part of the pattern, which then
# matches nothing and silently disables the rule. The two OAuth rules below were
# dead for exactly that reason. Keep every comment on its own line.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
**/api_keys.json
**/certs/
**/whatsapp_web/

# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
**/*.token

# Google OAuth client secrets
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
**/service_account*.json
**/secrets.json

# Private keys and keystores — anywhere in the tree, not only under certs/
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.ovpn
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

.env
.env.*
docs/

# ── Local tool state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .claude/settings.local.json stores absolute paths and per-machine permissions.
# Ignored here rather than relying on a global git ignore on one computer.
.claude/*.local.json

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.json
memory/*.db
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Downloaded and generated media ────────────────────────────────────────────
# providers/voices/ is where Piper drops its ~63 MB .onnx models by preference;
# the fallback lives in the OS user-data folder instead.
providers/voices/
*.onnx

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# uploads/ is the dashboard's last-resort upload folder, inside the project.
uploads/
downloads/
screenshots/
*.log
logs/

# ── Python build noise and tool caches ────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp
*~

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
